{"id":"f825bbc374884c6b","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-zfc-almost-disjoint-family.md","title":"ZFC Almost Disjoint Family","display":"df-zfc-almost-disjoint-family — ZFC Almost Disjoint Family","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-almost-disjoint-family","aliases":["58-df-zfc-almost-disjoint-family"],"display":"df-zfc-almost-disjoint-family — ZFC Almost Disjoint Family","depends_on":["[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-almost-disjoint-family"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-almost-disjoint-family</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-almost-disjoint-family — ZFC Almost Disjoint Family"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A\\in V\\land[\\omega]^\\omega\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq\\omega:\\neg\\mathrm{Finite}(A)\\}\">\\(\\mathcal A\\in V\\land[\\omega]^\\omega\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq\\omega:\\neg\\mathrm{Finite}(A)\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AlmostDisjointFamily}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{AlmostDisjointFamily}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}almost\\text{-}disjoint\\text{-}family\\text{-}predicate} \\vdash \\mathrm{AlmostDisjointFamily}_S(\\mathcal A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathcal A\\subseteq[\\omega]^\\omega\\land\\forall A,B\\in\\mathcal A\\;(A\\neq B\\to\\mathrm{Finite}(A\\cap B))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}almost\\text{-}disjoint\\text{-}family\\text{-}predicate} \\vdash \\mathrm{AlmostDisjointFamily}_S(\\mathcal A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathcal A\\subseteq[\\omega]^\\omega\\land\\forall A,B\\in\\mathcal A\\;(A\\neq B\\to\\mathrm{Finite}(A\\cap B))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Every member is infinite; only intersections of distinct members are required to be finite.</li>\n<li>The infinite-subset carrier is defined with the cited finiteness predicate, eliminating undeclared cardinality and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_0\">\\(\\aleph_0\\)</span> operators from this atom.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Finite}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal A\\in V\\land[\\omega]^\\omega\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq\\omega:\\neg\\mathrm{Finite}(A)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Finite}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AlmostDisjointFamily}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}almost\\text{-}disjoint\\text{-}family\\text{-}predicate} \\vdash \\mathrm{AlmostDisjointFamily}_S(\\mathcal A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathcal A\\subseteq[\\omega]^\\omega\\land\\forall A,B\\in\\mathcal A\\;(A\\neq B\\to\\mathrm{Finite}(A\\cap B))","display":true},{"tex":"\\aleph_0","display":false}],"bytes":1133,"backlinks":[{"id":"c87ad2d62e0fa0a4","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AlmostDisjointFamily}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch03/58-df-zfc-almost-disjoint-family.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1433","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-almost-disjoint-family.md|58-df-zfc-almost-disjoint-family]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["d9a25b0ac94a3598"]}